  "notes": "Announced together with Phi-4-reasoning-plus (inline variant) and Phi-4-mini-reasoning (separate record). The announcement page shows April 30, 2025; its metadata gives 2025-05-01T00:00Z. The model card description mentions supervised fine-tuning and reinforcement learning for both models, whereas the announcement and technical report reserve reinforcement learning for Phi-4-reasoning-plus; the record follows the announcement and report. The reasoning demonstrations used for fine-tuning were generated with a model from another organisation; that link is not recorded here."
